Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.82,En,,0,0,0,,Your agent can build almost anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.82,Zh,,0,0,0,,你的 Agent 几乎什么都能做。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:05.44,En,,0,0,0,,But it still picks one model for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:05.44,Zh,,0,0,0,,但它还是用同一个模型包办所有任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:11.31,En,,0,0,0,,A frontier model to classify a support ticket,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:11.31,Zh,,0,0,0,,一个全能模型，却用来给客服工单分类，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:14.40,En,,0,0,0,,to generate a barrel prop, to draft a thumbnail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:14.40,Zh,,0,0,0,,生成油桶道具、做缩略图。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.89,En,,0,0,0,,Most of that spend is wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.89,Zh,,0,0,0,,大部分钱都花错了地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:21.60,En,,0,0,0,,This is ModelPick. A decision layer that picks the best value
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:21.60,Zh,,0,0,0,,ModelPick 只做一件事：挑出最合适的模型——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.27,En,,0,0,0,,at every node.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.27,Zh,,0,0,0,,在每个节点。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:26.20,En,,0,0,0,,Not the cheapest — the best price-performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:26.20,Zh,,0,0,0,,不是最便宜，而是性价比最高，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.35,En,,0,0,0,,and prices it in cost per solved task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.35,Zh,,0,0,0,,并且按成功任务来算钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:35.80,En,,0,0,0,,Inside Claude Code, ask for a game-ready 3D asset. ModelPick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:35.80,Zh,,0,0,0,,在 Claude Code 里要一把 Unity 可用的 3D 剑。ModelPick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:40.00,En,,0,0,0,,compares Tripo, Hunyuan, and Meshy, applies the constraints,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:40.00,Zh,,0,0,0,,会对比 Tripo、混元、Meshy，套用约束，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.21,En,,0,0,0,,and returns one recommendation with the real cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.21,Zh,,0,0,0,,给出一个带真实成本的推荐。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:46.93,En,,0,0,0,,Twenty-one cents per usable asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:46.93,Zh,,0,0,0,,每个可用资产 0.21 美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:51.05,En,,0,0,0,,For a launch video, it plans the whole pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:51.05,Zh,,0,0,0,,做一条发布视频，它会把整条流水线排好。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:54.17,En,,0,0,0,,Script, keyframes, clips, voice, music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:54.17,Zh,,0,0,0,,脚本、关键帧、视频、配音、音乐。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:58.13,En,,0,0,0,,Five models, one budget, before a single frame renders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:58.13,Zh,,0,0,0,,五个模型，一个预算，在渲染第一帧前就定好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.50,En,,0,0,0,,One command installs it into Codex, Cursor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.50,Zh,,0,0,0,,一条命令接进 Codex、Cursor，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:06.10,En,,0,0,0,,DeepSeek Harness, or Copilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:06.10,Zh,,0,0,0,,以及 DeepSeek Harness、Copilot。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:09.60,En,,0,0,0,,A CLI, an MCP server, and a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:09.60,Zh,,0,0,0,,CLI、MCP 和 skill 都有。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:11.78,En,,0,0,0,,No gateway. No keys stored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:11.78,Zh,,0,0,0,,不需要网关，也不保存密钥。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:18.36,En,,0,0,0,,Every price has a source. Every decision is benchmarked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:18.36,Zh,,0,0,0,,每个价格都有出处，每个推荐都有测试。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:22.34,En,,0,0,0,,And the entire catalog is a JSON file you can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:22.34,Zh,,0,0,0,,整个目录就是一个你能改的 JSON 文件。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:28.12,En,,0,0,0,,ModelPick. Stop paying frontier prices for non-frontier work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:28.12,Zh,,0,0,0,,ModelPick。别再拿最贵的模型做最简单的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:31.18,En,,0,0,0,,Open source. MIT. On GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:31.18,Zh,,0,0,0,,开源，MIT，GitHub 见。
